        "events": {
          "wave": "unpleasant",
          "bigger": "bigger"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "why",
      "say": "One explanation: for our ancestors, missing a *threat* cost more than missing a snack.",
      "transition": "cut",
      "hold": 0.5,
      "visual": {
        "type": "page",
        "camera": [
          {
            "panel": "ancestor",
            "secs": 1.4
          }
        ],
        "events": {
          "threat": "threat",
          "snack": "snack"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "review",
      "say": "A big review of the research found the same pattern almost everywhere: relationships, feedback, first impressions, memory.",
      "transition": "cut",
      "hold": 0.5,
      "visual": {
        "type": "page",
        "camera": [
          {
            "panel": "review",
            "secs": 1.4
          }
        ],
        "events": {
          "d1": "relationships",
          "d2": "feedback",
          "d3": "first",
          "d4": "memory"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "tip",
      "say": "So when one comment stings, give the good ones equal airtime. Read them again. *Slowly*.",
      "transition": "cut",
      "hold": 0.5,
